#: ruleswidget.cpp:54
msgid ""
"Enable this checkbox to alter this window property for the specified "
"window(s)."
msgstr ""

#: ruleswidget.cpp:56
msgid ""
"Specify how the window property should be affected:"
"<ul>"
"<li><em>Do Not Affect:</em> The window property will not be affected and "
"therefore the default handling for it will be used. Specifying this will "
"block more generic window settings from taking effect.</li>"
"<li><em>Apply Initially:</em> The window property will be only set to the "
"given value after the window is created. No further changes will be "
"affected.</li>"
"<li><em>Remember:</em> The value of the window property will be remembered "
"and every time time the window is created, the last remembered value will be "
"applied.</li>"
"<li><em>Force:</em> The window property will be always forced to the given "
"value.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""

#: ruleswidget.cpp:66
msgid ""
"Specify how the window property should be affected:"
"<ul>"
